{"n": 764, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "764.webp", "text": "41-011\n\nSAFETY PRECAUTIONS WHEN REPAIRING GLASS FIBER REINFORCED\nPLASTIC PARTS\n\nGrinding dust must be removed on site with suitable extraction and a vacuum\ncleaner or machines with integrated extraction,\nProtective goggles and a mask must be worn during grinding operations.\n\nContorm with the following points when working with and storing polyester\nresins.\n\nPersona! Protective Equipment:\nGloves, goggles.\n\nWorking Hygiene;\n\nGood ventilation and regular washing of hands; no contact with food.\n\nEirst Ald;\nTake off dirty clothes immediately. If dust has gotten In eyes, rinse out thor-\noughly with water and go to a physician. Dab coated skin and wash thoroughly\n\nwith water and soap. If great amount of vapors are Inhaled, go outdoors In the\nfresh air and, if necessary, visit a physician.\n\nInformation on Toxicology:\n\nSystems containing styro! will irritate eyes, skin and the respiratory track. No\ndamaging effects are known from decades of use as long as handling Is\ncorrect.\n\nMeasures In Case of Fire;\n\nFire extingulshing agents: water mist'(no water stream), powders, foam, CO2\nand halon.\n\nScrapping:\n\nNever let it get Into drink water systems.\nit can be brought to a normal refuse station after hardening.", "words": [["41-011", 0.4681, 0.0332, 0.5405, 0.0564], ["SAFETY", 0.0304, 0.0796, 0.0755, 0.0915], ["PRECAUTIONS", 0.0805, 0.0802, 0.1601, 0.0915], ["WHEN", 0.1641, 0.0809, 0.1981, 0.0922], ["REPAIRING", 0.2026, 0.0809, 0.2644, 0.0928], ["GLASS", 0.269, 0.0809, 0.3075, 0.0928], ["FIBER", 0.3121, 0.0816, 0.3445, 0.0928], ["REINFORCED", 0.349, 0.0816, 0.423, 0.0928], ["PLASTIC", 0.0309, 0.0968, 0.0795, 0.1081], ["PARTS", 0.0841, 0.0968, 0.1206, 0.1081], ["Grinding", 0.0309, 0.1466, 0.0785, 0.1611], ["dust", 0.0826, 0.1479, 0.1054, 0.1585], ["must", 0.1094, 0.1492, 0.1348, 0.1585], ["be", 0.1393, 0.1485, 0.1515, 0.1592], ["removed", 0.156, 0.1485, 0.2026, 0.1592], ["on", 0.2057, 